          "content": {
            "id": "fe6ef4c8-6024-323c-a90a-05cc118b0db6",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Workers are 'wrestling' with speed of AI adoption: SailPoint CEO",
            "description": "<p>Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) announced on Tuesday that it will be laying off 14,000 corporate workers. This comes a day after Reuters initially reported that firings could <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/amazon-lay-off-30-000-195525529.html\">reach up to 30,000 roles</a> as the Big Tech giant leans heavier into AI adoption.</p>\n<p>SailPoint (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SAIL\">SAIL</a>) CEO & Founder Mark McClain compares the AI Boom's rate of growth as compared with past Industrial Revolutions, also sharing how tech companies are valuing the rate of growth while deploying artificial intelligence services that may reduce headcounts and boost productivity.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Amazon (AMZN) announced on Tuesday that it will be laying off 14,000 corporate workers. This comes a day after Reuters initially reported that firings could reach up to 30,000 roles as the Big Tech giant leans heavier into AI adoption. SailPoint (SAIL) CEO & Founder Mark McClain compares the AI Boom's rate of growth as compared with past Industrial Revolutions, also sharing how tech companies are valuing the rate of growth while deploying artificial intelligence services that may reduce headcounts and boost productivity. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Opening Bid.",
